{"id": "3035870", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3035870", "title": "Australian Open 2024 \u2013 Dublu mixt", "text": "Australian Open 2024 \u2013 Dublu mixt a avut loc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii ianuarie 2024. Treizeci \u0219i dou\u0103 de perechi de juc\u0103tori s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului australian de Grand Slam disputat la Melbourne Park. Luisa Stefani \u0219i Rafael Matos au fost campionii en-titre, dar au pierdut \u00een prima rund\u0103 \u00een fa\u021ba perechii Heather Watson \u0219i Joe Salisbury.\nHsieh Su-wei \u0219i Jan Zieli\u0144ski i-au \u00eenvins \u00een final\u0103 pe Desirae Krawczyk \u0219i Neal Skupski, cu 6\u20137(5\u20137), 6\u20134, [11\u20139] \u0219i au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul la dublu mixt la Australian Open 2024. Zieli\u0144ski a devenit primul juc\u0103tor polonez care a c\u00e2\u0219tigat dublu mixt la Australian Open.\nTabloul principal.\nFinal\u0103.\n&lt;section begin=\"mixt\" /&gt;\n&lt;section end=\"mixt\" /&gt;"}
