{"id": "3036900", "revid": "39098", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3036900", "title": "Hilton Valentine", "text": "Hilton Stewart Paterson Valentine () a fost un muzician englez skiffle \u0219i rock and roll, care a fost chitaristul original \u00een The Animals. A fost inclus \u00een Rock and Roll Hall of Fame \u00een 1994 \u0219i \u00een Rock Walk of Fame de la Hollywood \u00een 2001 \u00eempreun\u0103 cu ceilal\u021bi membri ai The Animals.\nDup\u0103 desp\u0103r\u021birea The Animals \u00een 1966, Valentine a produs mai multe albume solo, inclusiv \u201eAll in Your Head\u201d (1969) \u0219i \u201eIt\u2019s Folk \u2018N\u2019 Skiffle, Mate!\u2019\u2019 (2004). De asemenea, a f\u0103cut un turneu \u00een New England \u0219i a participat la mai multe reuniuni The Animals.\nDiscografie.\nAnimalele\nSolo"}
